{"title":"Fennel","sourceTitle":"Fennel/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Fennel\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Fennel (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Fennel/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Фенхель (6% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Fennel/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"茴香 (97% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Funcho</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Fennel.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Fennel.png/100px-Fennel.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Fennel.png/150px-Fennel.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f7/Fennel.png/200px-Fennel.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Comida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade</b>\n</td>\n<td>50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Categoria</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Legume <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>21  dias<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>4  dias<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.5<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Funcho</b> é uma <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vegetable\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vegetable\">vegetable</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vegetable\" title=\"Vegetable\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">crop</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>. É usado para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fishing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fishing\">stinkbait</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fishing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fishing\"> </a></span> para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fishing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fishing\">fishing</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fishing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fishing\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtenção\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtenção</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cultivo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cultivo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Comida\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comida</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Isca_Fedorenta\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Isca Fedorenta</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Armazenamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armazenamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#História\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">História</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obten.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtenção\">Obtenção</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Pequenos trechos de plantações de erva-doce podem ser encontrados durante a exploração, em áreas com os seguintes <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">temperature</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">precipitation</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World generation\">forestation</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"World generation\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Min. valor</th>\n<th>Máx. valor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>-10</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Chuva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>0.8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floresta</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.3\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Os pedaços que atendem a essas condições têm uma probabilidade de 2% de gerar de 2 a 8 culturas de erva-doce,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, que podem incluir uma mistura de culturas maduras e imaturas.\n</p><p>Sementes de erva-doce não podem ser encontradas em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked vessel\">cracked vessels</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> ou compradas em qualquer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">traders</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"Cultivation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cultivo\">Cultivo</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Mature_fennel.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c5/Mature_fennel.png/200px-Mature_fennel.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c5/Mature_fennel.png/300px-Mature_fennel.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c5/Mature_fennel.png/400px-Mature_fennel.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1440\" data-file-height=\"1440\" /></a><figcaption>Funcho maduro</figcaption></figure>\n<p>As culturas de erva-doce toleram temperaturas de -8 a 35°C,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> mas só crescem quando acima de 0°C. Se a temperatura cair abaixo de -8°C ou exceder 35°C, a colheita de erva-doce se tornará <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">“stunted”</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> e começará a acumular danos. As colheitas de erva-doce atrofiadas produzirão 75% do normal quando colhidas. Se acumularem danos suficientes para morrerem devido ao frio ou calor excessivo, as colheitas de erva-doce maduras produzirão 50% do normal quando colhidas.\n</p><p>As culturas de erva-doce consomem 40 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">nitrogen (N)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> em 9 estágios de crescimento.  Durante os estágios 7-8, as culturas de erva-doce alimentam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">bees</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">butterflies</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> As culturas de erva-doce tomam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Time\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">2.67 months</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Time\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> para amadurecer, assumindo uma taxa de crescimento próxima de 100%. Baixo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">moisture</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">nutrient levels</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> pode atrasar significativamente a maturação.\n</p><p>Cada bloco de culturas maduras de erva-doce produzirá 9 a 13 vegetais de erva-doce e 1 a 2 pacotes de sementes. A colheita no estágio 8 produzirá 2-4 erva-doce, com 99% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes. A colheita antes do estágio 8 tem 0% de chance de obter erva-doce e 70% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Food\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comida\">Comida</span></h3>\n<ul><li>A erva-doce pode ser consumida crua para saciedade de 50 vegetais.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-16\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Funcho pode ser usado como ingrediente <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">cooking</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> em refeições como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vegetable_stew\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vegetable stew\">vegetable stew</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vegetable_stew\" title=\"Vegetable stew\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Porridge\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Porridge\">porridge</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Porridge\" title=\"Porridge\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meat_stew\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meat stew\">meat stew</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meat_stew\" title=\"Meat stew\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Soup\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Soup\">soup</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Soup\" title=\"Soup\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Scrambled_eggs\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Scrambled eggs\">scrambled eggs</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Scrambled_eggs\" title=\"Scrambled eggs\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pie\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pie\">pie</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie\" title=\"Pie\"> </a></span>. Sua saciedade aumenta para 60 no produto final.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-17\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<ul><li>A erva-doce pode ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">pickled</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span> usando sal, o que aumenta sua vida útil e reduz sua saciedade para 40.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-18\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-18\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>18<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Stinkbait\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Isca_Fedorenta\">Isca Fedorenta</span></h3>\n<p>Funcho pode ser cozido com <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meat\">raw meat</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meat\" title=\"Meat\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dough\">dough</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dough\" title=\"Dough\"> </a></span> em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking_pot\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking pot\">cooking pot</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking_pot\" title=\"Cooking pot\"> </a></span> para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bait\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bait\">stinkbait</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bait\" title=\"Bait\"> </a></span>. Stinkbait pode ser anexado a um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fishing_pole\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fishing pole\">fishing pole</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fishing_pole\" title=\"Fishing pole\"> </a></span> e atrairá um conjunto específico de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fish\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fish\">fish</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fish\" title=\"Fish\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Storage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armazenamento\">Armazenamento</span></h2>\n<p>A erva-doce pode ser armazenada em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Storage_vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Storage vessel\">storage vessel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Storage_vessel\" title=\"Storage vessel\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\">cellar</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cellar\"> </a></span>, o que reduz sua velocidade de morte. Ele também pode ser colocado em todos os <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Containers\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Containers\">containers</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Containers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Containers\"> </a></span> estacionários, contêineres portáteis e no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ground_Storage\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ground Storage\">ground</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ground_Storage\" title=\"Ground Storage\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3ria\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"História\">História</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/1.22.0\" title=\"1.22.0\">1.22.0</a></b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"row\"><b><a href=\"/1.22.0-pre.1\" title=\"1.22.0-pre.1\">pre.1</a></b>\n</th>\n<td>A erva-doce foi adicionada como hortaliça. É usado principalmente para o novo sistema de pesca.\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notas\">Notas</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Jan-Jun, se a temperatura estiver entre 1-8°C às 16h, é bom para plantar sementes de erva-doce.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Crops-122-pre.1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Cultivo de erva-doce e alcaçuz a partir da versão prévia 1.22.0\"><img alt=\"description\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e1/Crops-122-pre.1.png/120px-Crops-122-pre.1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e1/Crops-122-pre.1.png/180px-Crops-122-pre.1.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e1/Crops-122-pre.1.png/240px-Crops-122-pre.1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"366\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Cultivo de erva-doce e alcaçuz a partir da versão prévia 1.22.0</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fertilizer\">Fertilizante</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fertilizer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fertilizer\"> </a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meal\">Refeição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meal\" title=\"Meal\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">Decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;not